          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca avuga ati: “Raba! Jewe mbonayo abantu bane bagendagenda mu muriro, bataboshe kandi ata na kimwe babaye, kandi uwugira kane asa n’umwana w’imana!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza aca aragenda yegera ku muryango w’iryo tanure hanyuma arasemerera cane ati: “Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, basavyi b’Imana Musumbavyose, nimusohoke! Nimuze hano!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego baca barasohoka bava muri iryo tanure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaganwa biwe, abajejwe urugo rwiwe, abatware n’abahanuzi biwe bose baraza barabashengerera. Baravye basanga umuriro ntiwigeze ubaturira na gatoya, ndetse n’umushatsi wabo nta co wigeze uba, impuzu zabo ntizahiye kandi babimotereje basanga nta n’umwotsi banuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Nebukadineza aca avuga ati: “Imana ya Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, iragahezagirwa kuko yarungitse umumarayika wayo gukiza aba basavyi bayo bayizigiye! Banse, kwumvira amategeko yanje, bemera gutanga imibiri yabo ngo iturirwe aho gukorera no gusenga iyindi mana itari Imana yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva ubu rero, ntanze iri tegeko ko umuntu wo mw’ihanga iryo ari ryo ryose canke w’ururimi urwo ari rwo rwose, azogira ijambo ribi avuga ku Mana ya Shadarake, Meshake, na Abedinego, azohimbagurwamwo ibihimba, kandi inzu yiwe ihinduke umusaka, kuko nta yindi mana ishobora gukiza nk’uku!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
